## SQ-MIN-01 | season-types, crop-seasons, food families read; arid tag has desert biomes
@group B
@commands boot; grep `logs/kubejs/server.log` for `season-types`, `crop-seasons`, `food families`; `/kubejs list_tag minecraft:worldgen/biome creativeengineering:seasons/arid` (or JEI tag view)
@pass no `could not read` / `not found` line; the arid tag has desert biomes
@fails jar copy missing (`unzip -l creativecalendar*.jar generation_scripts/`), or `WorldgenFiles.existing` not reaching nested jars
@from batches/r1113/c3_ch1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
kjsreject (season-types|crop-seasons|food families).*(could not read|not found)
shell grep -hE "season-types|crop-seasons|food families" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | cut -c1-200 | head -6
> cdevtest tag biome creativecalendar:seasons/arid
waitlog verb=tag kind=biome tag=creativecalendar:seasons/arid n= 30
expect verb=tag kind=biome tag=creativecalendar:seasons/arid n=[1-9]\d* ids=\S*minecraft:desert
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look tag id is creativecalendar:seasons/arid (row: creativeengineering:seasons/arid, before the 2026-11-09 namespace move)

