## SQ-MIN-03 | reduced set: no Constructor for / errored recipe / incomplete failed / ReferenceError / Couldn't parse loot table; no ERR hit
@group B
@commands grep `latest.log` for `Constructor for`, `errored recipe`, `incomplete failed`, `ReferenceError`, `Couldn't parse loot table`
@pass none
@fails the KubeJS addons are not in `mods/` (the jars now refuse to load without them)
@from batches/r1115/p7_ch.qb
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory
shell grep -nE "Constructor for|errored recipe|incomplete failed|ReferenceError|Couldn't parse loot table" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/*.log | cut -c1-300 | head -10
shell test "$(cat logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/*.log | grep -cE "Constructor for|errored recipe|incomplete failed|ReferenceError|Couldn't parse loot table")" = 0
shell grep -nE "Failed to load datapacks|Couldn't parse loot table|Unknown registry key|Parsing error loading recipe|Couldn't load tag|Can't find block|Unknown item" logs/latest.log | grep -iE "vintagedelight:blocks/fd_|rusticdelight|hearthandharvest|creativedelight:blocks/placed_|storagedelight|creativeengineering:sawmill" | cut -c1-300 | head -8; echo "ERR lines naming the row list: $(grep -E "Failed to load datapacks|Couldn't parse loot table|Unknown registry key|Parsing error loading recipe|Couldn't load tag|Can't find block|Unknown item" logs/latest.log | grep -ciE "vintagedelight:blocks/fd_|rusticdelight|hearthandharvest|creativedelight:blocks/placed_|storagedelight|creativeengineering:sawmill")"
shell test "$(grep -E "Failed to load datapacks|Couldn't parse loot table|Unknown registry key|Parsing error loading recipe|Couldn't load tag|Can't find block|Unknown item" logs/latest.log | grep -ciE "vintagedelight:blocks/fd_|rusticdelight|hearthandharvest|creativedelight:blocks/placed_|storagedelight|creativeengineering:sawmill")" = 0
shell ls mods | grep -ciE 'corn_delight'; true
look none of the five lines; no ERR hit in the row list

